WEBVTT

00:16.640 --> 00:17.380
Umemiya.

00:19.970 --> 00:21.470
We've got real trouble.

00:23.320 --> 00:25.090
Yeah, I know.

00:27.520 --> 00:28.890
He already knows?

00:29.730 --> 00:30.760
Who told him?

00:32.170 --> 00:34.890
We don't have enough
seedlings for our plots!

00:36.640 --> 00:38.390
There's one extra plot.

00:38.740 --> 00:40.480
There anything you wanna eat?

00:41.000 --> 00:42.640
No. It's Lion's Head, they're…

00:42.640 --> 00:46.120
Habanero?! Are you sure?
Don't you have a weak stomach?

00:46.620 --> 00:49.120
Th-They're not on the same page…

00:49.350 --> 00:53.390
Now I get it. That's the cause
behind Hiragi's stomach pains.

00:55.400 --> 00:57.900
That's Umemiya…?

00:59.610 --> 01:02.400
That's Mister Umemiya to you.

01:02.660 --> 01:03.520
Get bent!

01:05.150 --> 01:08.240
Huh? What's up? Why's everyone up here?

01:10.140 --> 01:10.740
Hey!

01:12.190 --> 01:13.530
These are tomatoes.

01:13.980 --> 01:15.140
Those, green peppers.

01:15.280 --> 01:17.600
Then eggplants, cukes, and okra!

01:18.820 --> 01:21.330
All cute in their own way, aren't they?

01:25.540 --> 01:26.470
It's okay.

01:29.370 --> 01:31.010
Seriously, this guy…

01:31.210 --> 01:32.830
He never listens.

01:32.900 --> 01:35.530
And once he starts talking, he doesn't stop.

01:36.090 --> 01:37.410
Dammit…

01:37.990 --> 01:40.100
They're plants. What's the difference?

01:40.880 --> 01:44.530
Whaaat? Look closer! They're completely different!

01:45.720 --> 01:47.020
Thinking on it…

01:47.690 --> 01:49.710
He was like this on the broadcast.

01:49.830 --> 01:51.370
Kind of a goof.

01:52.300 --> 01:55.900
But his voice was all it took to change the mood.

01:56.640 --> 01:58.970
I hope they produce a lot.

01:59.390 --> 02:02.310
What is it about this guy
that draws people to him?

02:05.570 --> 02:06.270
Excuse me!

02:08.150 --> 02:11.590
Please let me… explain… what happened today!

02:12.330 --> 02:15.070
It's hard to stay quiet in a situation like this.

02:15.910 --> 02:18.510
I saw a shoplifter on the shopping street.

02:19.270 --> 02:23.230
I chased him, and before I knew it
I was in Lion's Head turf…

02:24.460 --> 02:27.680
They chased me, and right when
I was about to give up…

02:28.410 --> 02:30.220
These two saved me!

02:31.300 --> 02:32.950
I admire Bofurin,

02:33.460 --> 02:34.590
and got carried away,

02:35.480 --> 02:39.500
and ended up sparking a clash with Lion's Head…

02:41.320 --> 02:43.340
I'm… so sorry!

02:47.720 --> 02:48.560
Sasaki.

02:50.610 --> 02:52.460
How did you know my name?

02:53.140 --> 02:54.280
Thanks, bud.

02:58.060 --> 02:59.750
You sparked a clash, sure,

03:00.060 --> 03:03.620
because you were trying to protect
the town and its people, yeah?

03:04.100 --> 03:06.370
Then you have nothing to apologize for.

03:06.890 --> 03:07.920
As for the rest…

03:10.380 --> 03:12.690
Leave it to your big bros here!

03:16.010 --> 03:16.600
So…

03:17.520 --> 03:19.700
How'd these guys save you?

03:19.920 --> 03:22.670
Oh, uh, they kicked the guy off his feet…

03:22.760 --> 03:24.210
Off his feet?!

03:27.640 --> 03:30.200
I bet those guys hated that!

03:30.440 --> 03:32.890
Sure, they're not great listeners, but still!

03:33.090 --> 03:35.440
Oh, man, you kicked him off his feet?

03:37.540 --> 03:40.040
They did it while I was with them. I'm sorry.

03:40.410 --> 03:43.650
Hiragi, you can't take
responsibility for everything.

03:44.260 --> 03:46.810
I'm the one who told you to keep an eye on them.

03:47.120 --> 03:49.310
Come on, you'll wreck your stomach again.

03:49.850 --> 03:53.410
Besides, it was Sakura who pushed things too far.

03:53.510 --> 03:56.000
Sh-Shut up! You didn't have to say that!

03:56.400 --> 03:58.500
What, you pick a fight?

03:58.820 --> 04:03.610
Th-They said strength was everything,
but beat up on a weak guy,

04:03.670 --> 04:05.660
which is lame, so I…

04:06.790 --> 04:07.290
said so…

04:08.950 --> 04:10.400
You spat it all out.

04:13.100 --> 04:14.590
Alright, I get it.

04:18.010 --> 04:18.500
Mhm!

04:18.980 --> 04:19.780
Well said!

04:20.500 --> 04:20.940
Huh?

04:21.490 --> 04:24.960
I was thinking they've been
pretty lame recently, myself!

04:25.730 --> 04:28.410
Sakura, I heard what you did on the main street.

04:29.150 --> 04:31.220
And you saved Sasaki today.

04:31.950 --> 04:34.310
Thanks for protecting our family.

04:34.720 --> 04:37.300
I'm glad to have such a reliable new little bro!

04:42.330 --> 04:46.120
What's going on? The tips
of my ears are feeling hot…

04:47.180 --> 04:49.100
I hate how relaxing this feels…

04:51.300 --> 04:55.120
I think I get why everyone is drawn to him now…

04:56.410 --> 04:58.710
Having him here makes you feel safe.

05:00.960 --> 05:02.970
Who went and made you my big bro?!

05:04.120 --> 05:07.800
I think of everyone in this town as family.

05:12.890 --> 05:14.400
Kaji? What's up?

05:15.500 --> 05:16.490
Lion's…

05:17.370 --> 05:18.140
Head…

05:18.620 --> 05:21.000
Hey, Kaji! Kaji?! What's wrong?!

05:21.340 --> 05:22.990
What's up? Something happen?

05:23.490 --> 05:25.590
Knock knooock!

05:30.150 --> 05:33.600
Knock knock, knock knock, knock knock!

05:34.550 --> 05:36.990
Knock knooock!

05:39.740 --> 05:42.210
I'm the leader of Lion's Head,

05:42.860 --> 05:44.430
Tomiyama Choji!

05:47.010 --> 05:50.860
Ume, let's have us a nice, clean…

05:51.290 --> 05:54.010
fight, fight, fight!

07:27.750 --> 07:29.500
Th-Their leader?!

07:29.540 --> 07:31.510
What's their leader doing here?!

07:31.560 --> 07:33.290
Revenge?! War?!

07:35.460 --> 07:37.400
Lion's Head's second-in-command,

07:37.760 --> 07:38.720
Togame Jo!

07:39.070 --> 07:40.390
Then that means…

07:41.050 --> 07:43.320
This guy's stronger than him?!

07:50.220 --> 07:51.250
What was that?

07:53.230 --> 07:54.760
Eh?! S-Sakura?!

07:57.240 --> 07:59.670
Suo! Sugishita!

08:00.380 --> 08:01.600
Even you, Sasaki?!

08:02.360 --> 08:04.590
W-Wait for me!

08:09.130 --> 08:10.600
You guys stay here.

08:11.180 --> 08:13.810
Screw that! If we're fighting, let me in!

08:15.010 --> 08:16.320
I won't repeat myself.

08:18.800 --> 08:19.470
Oh, crap…

08:21.260 --> 08:23.110
My legs won't move…

08:23.860 --> 08:27.790
Is this really the same person
as that goof from before…?

08:30.610 --> 08:31.990
Hey, Tomiyama.

08:32.400 --> 08:33.800
That's a nice gift.

08:34.140 --> 08:35.690
It's one of ours.

08:36.320 --> 08:37.950
Mhm. I know.

08:38.700 --> 08:40.510
You mad? Are ya?!

08:41.600 --> 08:42.890
You seem happy.

08:45.600 --> 08:48.720
He's laughing right in Umemiya's face…

08:49.270 --> 08:50.640
What kinda monster is he?

08:50.940 --> 08:52.790
Alright, Ume!

08:54.130 --> 08:56.480
One-on-one! One-on-one!

08:58.150 --> 09:01.040
You guys started it, after all!

09:01.350 --> 09:03.610
That's more than enough reason to fight!

09:06.300 --> 09:09.120
One-on-one! One-on-one!

09:09.280 --> 09:11.210
- This dude has zero chill.
- One-on-one!

09:12.150 --> 09:14.830
It is true that we made the first move.

09:16.500 --> 09:17.000
Oh?

09:18.190 --> 09:21.840
But, you see, you've already done plenty.

09:22.430 --> 09:23.620
Plenty enough.

09:24.300 --> 09:25.380
We're even now.

09:26.000 --> 09:26.500
Huh?

09:26.930 --> 09:28.870
Ahh… huh.

09:29.410 --> 09:30.090
We are?

09:30.530 --> 09:33.000
He… He accepted it?

09:35.060 --> 09:36.550
You should hurry back home…

09:43.190 --> 09:43.920
Ugh.

09:44.320 --> 09:46.210
You're impatient as ever.

09:51.450 --> 09:55.500
There, Ume! I started it! Now it's your turn!

09:55.820 --> 09:57.660
Come on, hurry, hit me back!

09:58.740 --> 10:00.800
Why do you wanna fight so bad?

10:01.250 --> 10:01.730
Eh?

10:02.110 --> 10:05.630
Hmm… It's not so much I wanna fight as…

10:07.220 --> 10:08.760
I want you.

10:13.110 --> 10:13.670
You see,

10:14.420 --> 10:17.520
it's been so boring since I became top dog.

10:18.110 --> 10:22.920
But you're also top dog, and you're
always laughing and having fun!

10:24.610 --> 10:26.100
That's just not fair.

10:27.620 --> 10:32.490
That's why I want to make Furin mine…
and you with it!

10:35.960 --> 10:38.680
Th-That's just crazy…

10:41.080 --> 10:42.080
I see.

10:43.690 --> 10:46.230
It must have been rough, Tomiyama.

10:47.520 --> 10:48.020
Huh?

10:48.310 --> 10:49.720
Hey, now.

10:50.690 --> 10:54.420
Don't go spouting gibberish at our boss.

10:55.080 --> 10:57.570
Eh? What are you all doin' here?

10:59.290 --> 11:04.170
You know, boss, assaulting them
on your own like this…

11:06.270 --> 11:08.200
won't solve anything.

11:08.990 --> 11:10.290
I can't believe you.

11:11.160 --> 11:12.710
The moment I told you,

11:12.880 --> 11:14.520
you flew right off.

11:15.140 --> 11:17.990
I always tell you to listen until the end, so…

11:18.720 --> 11:20.210
Hey, Reversi.

11:21.050 --> 11:22.280
We meet again.

11:22.890 --> 11:24.860
Yo, Shaggy.

11:25.070 --> 11:26.620
Hey, they already…

11:26.620 --> 11:27.300
Shut it!

11:28.010 --> 11:29.710
I won't stop a duel,

11:30.450 --> 11:32.330
but I won't stand for an invasion!

11:34.460 --> 11:37.890
Ughhh, we were right about to duel!

11:38.000 --> 11:39.640
Back off, everyone!

11:40.060 --> 11:41.210
Hmm…

11:41.740 --> 11:45.200
I don't think mano-a-mano is in the cards here.

11:46.250 --> 11:47.390
Look around.

11:47.740 --> 11:48.240
Eh?

11:54.040 --> 11:56.790
Whoa! Th-This is bad!

11:58.680 --> 12:01.610
Nobody move! At all!

12:04.680 --> 12:08.030
Tomiyama, I'll take you on. One-on-one.

12:09.010 --> 12:10.880
Make your guys stand down.

12:11.520 --> 12:14.770
Sure thing! As long as we get to go!

12:14.890 --> 12:16.140
What gives?

12:16.700 --> 12:19.450
Their boss sure is a softie.

12:19.700 --> 12:21.610
Or maybe he's just scared?

12:21.610 --> 12:23.370
Oi. I'll wreck you.

12:23.710 --> 12:26.280
Don't get mad at me for hitting the mark.

12:27.210 --> 12:29.600
Hey, man, wasn't he on the scene?

12:30.040 --> 12:35.550
See? I knew it! And he's so plain!
Go me, recognizing him!

12:36.890 --> 12:39.540
You look tough, but you talk cute?

12:39.740 --> 12:40.530
How adorable.

12:41.770 --> 12:42.610
Screw you.

12:43.620 --> 12:46.570
Come on, let's all calm down.

12:47.370 --> 12:48.560
Hey, Choji.

12:48.910 --> 12:52.600
Even if you want a duel,
you should save it for another day.

12:52.930 --> 12:53.580
What?!

12:53.820 --> 12:56.580
I mean, it's getting dark already.

12:57.430 --> 12:59.520
If you go at it in the dark…

13:00.500 --> 13:03.830
nobody can see any faces get smashed in.

13:04.260 --> 13:06.390
Isn't that right, Reversi?

13:06.990 --> 13:09.360
How can you see your own face?

13:10.990 --> 13:13.400
Wait, were you all involved?

13:14.010 --> 13:15.610
In that case, Ume,

13:16.400 --> 13:17.860
let's all get in on it!

13:18.220 --> 13:18.930
What?

13:19.120 --> 13:20.920
Oh, I don't mean a brawl.

13:21.210 --> 13:23.520
I mean a bunch of one-on-ones!

13:23.800 --> 13:26.120
It'll be like a fun little festival!

13:26.730 --> 13:29.720
Oh, like a kendo team match?

13:30.030 --> 13:31.060
Sounds good.

13:31.090 --> 13:32.280
Doesn't it just?

13:32.670 --> 13:33.250
- In that case…

13:33.250 --> 13:34.550
- I like it, I like it!
- In that case…

13:35.120 --> 13:36.480
We should pick…

13:36.490 --> 13:37.570
Yes, yes!

13:37.630 --> 13:38.870
Let me finish.

13:39.430 --> 13:41.080
'Kay, the combatants will be…

13:41.330 --> 13:42.500
Choji and…

13:42.970 --> 13:44.020
Umemiya.

13:45.830 --> 13:46.920
Me and…

13:47.420 --> 13:48.510
Reversi.

13:48.930 --> 13:49.780
It's Sakura.

13:50.110 --> 13:52.280
Let me take the long-haired guy.

13:53.900 --> 13:56.320
Then I'll take Patchy.

13:56.590 --> 13:58.840
A cute guy picked me!

13:59.060 --> 14:02.100
Hey. If you want a duel, just us two is enough.

14:02.330 --> 14:05.490
What? It'll be more fun with everyone!

14:06.050 --> 14:06.900
We agree.

14:07.970 --> 14:09.750
We'd like that more.

14:10.920 --> 14:12.200
You heard 'em!

14:13.350 --> 14:15.610
Jeez, this year's new kids…

14:17.670 --> 14:19.650
Can I… join, too?

14:21.440 --> 14:22.490
I want Hiragi.

14:24.280 --> 14:26.330
Sako, you…

14:28.590 --> 14:30.310
Sorry, Umemiya.

14:31.470 --> 14:32.520
I'm joining in.

14:37.710 --> 14:40.150
Great, let's go with these members!

14:40.490 --> 14:42.630
We'll put our teams on the line…

14:46.010 --> 14:48.690
and have a fun, all-out fight!

15:03.920 --> 15:05.590
Is it okay for me to be here?

15:05.730 --> 15:06.710
Of course it is.

15:08.070 --> 15:10.730
This is bad, bad, bad! Just terrible!

15:11.040 --> 15:12.910
It's a real disaster!

15:13.280 --> 15:14.710
Can you shut it already?

15:15.010 --> 15:18.000
And whose fault do you think
it is that this happened?!

15:19.030 --> 15:21.500
Stressing out won't change it, Nirei.

15:22.900 --> 15:25.520
Try eating something. It'll calm you down.

15:25.750 --> 15:27.950
You just don't get it, Kotoha.

15:28.540 --> 15:32.310
This is just a hypothetical,
but what if… what if, tomorrow,

15:32.400 --> 15:35.930
Umemiya loses to Tomiyama Choji…

15:38.510 --> 15:41.590
Lion's Head would take over Bofurin.

15:41.890 --> 15:44.340
Bofurin might stop existing!

15:44.430 --> 15:47.880
That doesn't mean stressing will change anything.

15:49.050 --> 15:54.100
Don't worry. These guys aren't
that weak. You know that.

16:01.390 --> 16:03.700
Hey, I'm done eating. Can I go now?

16:03.770 --> 16:04.430
So fast!

16:04.810 --> 16:06.010
Hey, your veggies.

16:06.610 --> 16:09.700
But wait, Umemiya and Hiragi aren't here.

16:09.990 --> 16:11.200
They're way late!

16:11.580 --> 16:13.910
They told us to wait, but aren't showing.

16:14.300 --> 16:15.010
Well, yeah…

16:15.400 --> 16:18.950
They had to talk down everyone
who was ready for blood.

16:19.680 --> 16:20.710
Yeah, but…

16:21.350 --> 16:23.810
Umemiya said we were gonna get a meal.

16:23.930 --> 16:25.200
Why are we at a cafe?

16:25.200 --> 16:27.390
You just finished a rice omelette, dude.

16:28.980 --> 16:32.290
This has been a known Bofurin
gathering spot for a long time.

16:32.950 --> 16:35.190
Apparently they gather here before fights.

16:35.690 --> 16:36.490
After all…

16:38.560 --> 16:39.200
Ko…

16:39.590 --> 16:40.170
to…

16:40.710 --> 16:42.080
ha!

16:43.130 --> 16:45.330
Your hairstyle's as cute as ever!

16:45.430 --> 16:46.780
It looks great on ya!

16:47.220 --> 16:47.820
That so?

16:48.080 --> 16:51.090
Oh, right, you know
the seedlings I told you about?

16:51.520 --> 16:53.520
Look how big they've gotten!

16:53.610 --> 16:55.630
I can even send some here this summer!

16:55.860 --> 16:57.250
Looking forward to it.

16:57.450 --> 16:58.820
What's all that about?

16:58.950 --> 17:01.890
As you can see, Umemiya's fond of her.

17:02.820 --> 17:05.420
Wh-What, is she his g-girlfriend?!

17:06.090 --> 17:07.780
Ahaha, not quite.

17:08.040 --> 17:09.010
Not at all!

17:09.510 --> 17:11.400
Ugh, don't be an idiot.

17:11.640 --> 17:13.390
Yeah, don't be an idiot!

17:13.720 --> 17:15.540
She's nothing so trivial as that!

17:16.130 --> 17:17.750
[Ta-da!]
She's my little sister!

17:17.790 --> 17:19.230
That's not it, either!

17:20.300 --> 17:21.390
Then what is it?

17:26.900 --> 17:29.030
We were raised in the same institution.

17:29.320 --> 17:31.600
Ume decided to call us siblings on his own.

17:32.780 --> 17:33.860
What,

17:34.420 --> 17:35.700
that's all?

17:40.680 --> 17:41.130
Huh?

17:41.530 --> 17:42.350
Wait a sec…

17:42.950 --> 17:44.700
Little sister? Not big?

17:44.850 --> 17:45.520
Right.

17:45.630 --> 17:46.780
How old are you?

17:46.910 --> 17:48.750
Sixteen. Same as you.

17:48.880 --> 17:50.070
Don't lie!

17:50.210 --> 17:51.980
You're too mature for sixteen!

17:52.180 --> 17:53.520
You gotta be at least twe…

17:55.180 --> 17:57.690
You coulda killed me! What's your deal?!

17:57.970 --> 17:59.420
You're exactly right.

18:02.190 --> 18:04.460
Kotoha sure seems mature.

18:05.810 --> 18:08.130
Sugishita, you card.

18:08.300 --> 18:10.190
You can't just throw things.

18:12.430 --> 18:15.070
Umemiya dotes on Kotoha.

18:15.780 --> 18:19.140
If he finds out she was in danger…

18:21.080 --> 18:22.100
You know the rest.

18:23.810 --> 18:24.300
Yeah.

18:25.290 --> 18:27.220
Deee-lish!

18:27.400 --> 18:30.330
Kotoha's rice omelettes are the best in all Japan!

18:30.580 --> 18:31.710
Shut up and eat.

18:36.010 --> 18:37.840
What, not gonna eat, Hiragi?

18:39.280 --> 18:39.980
No, I am.

18:41.940 --> 18:44.430
I was just thinking about the old Lion's Head.

18:45.060 --> 18:48.610
I was thinking they've been
pretty lame recently, myself!

18:49.190 --> 18:51.330
Did they used to be different?

18:52.700 --> 18:54.590
They believe in strength alone…

18:55.720 --> 19:00.190
Lion's Head used to simply
care about strong fighters.

19:01.060 --> 19:03.200
Sure, they had a lot of hotheads,

19:03.620 --> 19:06.570
but they never would have
chased a middle-schooler.

19:07.500 --> 19:11.090
We once had a big clash with them.

19:11.620 --> 19:13.130
It was a huge brawl,

19:13.600 --> 19:16.210
but I remember it being oddly satisfying.

19:17.360 --> 19:20.490
But ever since Tomiyama took over,

19:20.720 --> 19:22.720
bad rumors started spreading.

19:23.650 --> 19:25.640
He's pulled these stunts before.

19:26.090 --> 19:30.200
I've heard plenty of stories
of him picking fights all over.

19:30.890 --> 19:37.770
Tomiyama and Togame used to be symbols
of strength who cared deeply for their team.

19:38.970 --> 19:40.950
Why'd they have to end up like this?

19:43.220 --> 19:43.820
Well,

19:44.350 --> 19:46.300
it's probably Tomiyama's fault.

19:46.880 --> 19:48.560
His fault? How?

19:49.150 --> 19:50.550
I dunno the specifics.

19:52.940 --> 19:54.790
You'll see if you talk tomorrow.

19:56.260 --> 19:58.840
Talk? We're going to fight tomorrow.

19:59.020 --> 20:02.590
Oh, please. Fights are conversations, Sakura.

20:04.400 --> 20:08.010
Punches are a language
that sometimes works better than words.

20:08.680 --> 20:11.440
Though I guess that's only true for guys like us.

20:12.850 --> 20:14.970
Kotoha, I want seconds!

20:15.090 --> 20:17.490
Last order's come and gone.

20:19.400 --> 20:20.240
Alright.

20:20.780 --> 20:22.540
Don't be late tomorrow!

20:23.310 --> 20:25.820
I'll be back, Kotoha!

20:27.780 --> 20:29.670
U-Um, everyone!

20:30.920 --> 20:32.810
I never thanked you properly.

20:33.550 --> 20:35.710
Thank you for saving me!

20:36.280 --> 20:39.000
And I hope you win tomorrow!

20:40.820 --> 20:41.350
No prob.

20:41.520 --> 20:43.440
Don't worry about it. It's fine.

20:44.640 --> 20:45.400
We'll try.

20:45.750 --> 20:48.380
I-It's not like I'm fighting for you or…

20:48.380 --> 20:49.360
You dope.

20:50.870 --> 20:53.780
You can just say, "Leave it to me."

20:55.770 --> 20:58.040
Leave it to your big bros here!

20:59.750 --> 21:00.480
L…

21:01.070 --> 21:02.170
Leave it to me.

21:03.040 --> 21:03.780
Good.

21:04.320 --> 21:06.540
You're bright red, Sakura!

21:07.300 --> 21:08.240
Shut up!

21:10.500 --> 21:12.110
Fights are conversations.

21:12.680 --> 21:13.980
Punches are a language.

21:15.740 --> 21:17.230
I never thought about that.

21:24.140 --> 21:25.050
Alright.

21:25.420 --> 21:26.700
Now we're all here,

21:27.450 --> 21:28.490
let's head in!

21:30.050 --> 21:34.530
This is the first time I've ever
fought for someone else…

21:36.200 --> 21:36.870
But…

21:37.510 --> 21:39.070
I don't know why, but…

21:40.580 --> 21:42.960
I feel more unbeatable than ever!

21:47.680 --> 21:49.030
Hey, Ume!

21:49.550 --> 21:51.980
Welcome, come on in!

21:52.600 --> 21:53.400
Hey.

21:54.710 --> 21:55.830
Here we are.

21:57.000 --> 22:00.010
[#04: Clash]

23:30.600 --> 23:33.520
Hey, Sakura, I kinda had a feeling already,

23:33.700 --> 23:35.200
but do you not like veggies?

23:36.410 --> 23:38.310
What, you got a problem with that?!

23:38.800 --> 23:42.030
It's not like not eating them will hurt me!

23:42.360 --> 23:46.000
But our primo, Umemiya, grows veggies.

23:46.380 --> 23:49.400
Maybe they're a source of strength?

23:50.220 --> 23:51.050
So basically…

23:51.560 --> 23:54.930
You're trying to say I'm weak
because I don't eat them?!

23:55.110 --> 23:56.880
No, not at all!

23:56.980 --> 23:59.020
Let's take this outside, chump!
